	<description>
		<p>Vulpine helps you to visualize and interact with command line tools. It is a simple and user cross-platform, opensource app built with tauri and rust.</p>
		<p>Features:</p>
		<ul>
			<li>Create app configuration files inside the app</li>
			<li>Create complex actions using a domain specific language</li>
			<li>Run apps with a single click</li>
			<li>Add input fields to apps</li>
			<li>Share apps with others</li>
			<li>Cross platform on windows, linux and macos (mobile and web in the future)</li>
		</ul>
	</description>
